            3616                     !+---+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
            3617                     !> - Calculate y-intercept, slope values for rain.
            3618                     !+---+-----------------------------------------------------------------+
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
                                   <<<  [PARALLELIZATION]
                                   <<<    Standard iteration count: 22
                                   <<<  [OPTIMIZATION]
